    "某些字段的值是指向另一条目的路径（如笔记的 annotates 指向被批注的章节），据此建立关联。源类型 / 字段名 / 关联类型 三项都要填；全部删空则恢复内置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some field values are paths to another entry (for example, a note’s annotates field points to the annotated chapter); these create relations. Fill in the source type, field name, and related type. Clearing every field restores the built-in settings."
          }
        },
