    "默认存于本机；改到外挂盘/网络盘会变成完整拷贝（无块去重）。云同步请同步文库本体而非备份目录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stored locally by default. Moving this to an external or network volume creates full copies without block deduplication. For cloud sync, sync the library itself rather than the backup directory."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认存于本机；改到外挂盘/网络盘会变成完整拷贝（无块去重）。云同步请同步文库本体而非备份目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
